      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've been saying this for agers!!! YES!!!\n\nAnd unlike people suggest: NO, turning off flick select doesn't solve the problem!\n\nThe point is drift making you click somewhere you didn't intend when it randomly triggers, especially when your just trying to change your height in the action menu, then end up drifting onto the reset avatar button as soon as you go to click height adjust or reset height Dx   a LOT of people i know with drift avoid even changing avatar height just so they don't risk going into the same menu as the reset button, particularly on avatars that rely on saving stuff such as the fishing prefab or other saveable prefabs  :[",
      "viewerReactions": null,
